## Tutorials

❮ Java Keywords

Thecasekeyword marks a block of code in aswitchstatement.

Read more about the switch statement in ourJava Switch Tutorial.

❮ Java Keywords

### Code Examples

```
Example
Calculate the weekday name:
int day = 4;
switch (day) {
  case 1:
    System.out.println("Monday");
    break;
  case 2:
    System.out.println("Tuesday");
    break;
  case 3:
    System.out.println("Wednesday");
    break;
  case 4:
    System.out.println("Thursday");
    break;
  case 5:
    System.out.println("Friday");
    break;
  case 6:
    System.out.println("Saturday");
    break;
  case 7:
    System.out.println("Sunday");
    break;
}
// Outputs "Thursday" (day 4)
Try it Yourself »
```

